OL,3,CThe Odyssey becomes highest-grossing
OL,4,Cfilm of Christopher Nolan's career
OL,6,FThe Odyssey has become the highest-
OL,7,Fgrossing film of Sir Christopher
OL,8,FNolan's career, having made more than
OL,9,Fone billion US dollars at the global
OL,10,Fbox office less than a month after its
OL,11,Frelease.
OL,13,FThe blockbuster, which was released on
OL,14,FJuly 17, is an adaptation of Homer's
OL,15,Fancient Greek epic and follows Matt
OL,16,FDamon as Odysseus, the Greek king of
OL,17,FIthaca, on his perilous 10-year
OL,18,Fjourney home after the Trojan War.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/7
