OL,3,CThe Odyssey becomes highest-grossing
OL,4,Cfilm of Christopher Nolan's career
OL,6,FThe film, which has received strong
OL,7,Freviews from critics, has grossed
OL,8,F$1.104 billion (#819 million)
OL,9,Fworldwide ` making it the most
OL,10,Fsuccessful of his career.
OL,12,FIt has beaten his previous record-
OL,13,Fholder, the 2012 Batman film The Dark
OL,14,FKnight Rises, which earned $1.085
OL,15,Fbillion (#805.70 million), while its
OL,16,F2008 predecessor, The Dark Knight,
OL,17,Fgrossed $1.005 billion (#745 million).
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/7
