OL,3,CThe Odyssey becomes highest-grossing
OL,4,Cfilm of Christopher Nolan's career
OL,6,FNolan has directed blockbusters such
OL,7,Fas Tenet, Dunkirk and Interstellar,
OL,8,Fwith his movies having now grossed
OL,9,Fmore than $7 billion (#5.198 billion)
OL,10,Fglobally.
OL,12,FThe 56-year-old Oscar-winning
OL,13,Ffilmmaker wrote and directed The
OL,14,FOdyssey, which he also produced
OL,15,Falongside his wife, Dame Emma Thomas.
OL,17,FThe film features a star-studded cast
OL,18,Fincluding Damon, Anne Hathaway and
OL,19,FRobert Pattinson ` and has become the
OL,20,Fhighest-grossing of all three actors'
OL,21,Fcareers globally.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/7
