OL,3,CThe Odyssey becomes highest-grossing
OL,4,Cfilm of Christopher Nolan's career
OL,6,FThe three-hour-long epic also stars
OL,7,FZendaya, Tom Holland, Charlize Theron
OL,8,Fand Lupita Nyong'o.
OL,10,FThe Odyssey debuted at number one
OL,11,Fglobally and it remained in the top
OL,12,Fposition for two consecutive weekends
OL,13,Fboth domestically and internationally.
OL,15,FIt was made with production companies
OL,16,FSyncopy and Universal Pictures, and is
OL,17,Fone of three Universal films to have
OL,18,Fgrossed $1 billion globally this year,
OL,19,Falongside The Super Mario Galaxy Movie
OL,20,Fand Michael.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/7
