OL,3,CThe Odyssey becomes highest-grossing
OL,4,Cfilm of Christopher Nolan's career
OL,6,FUniversal also produced Oppenheimer,
OL,7,Fthe 2023 thriller starring Cillian
OL,8,FMurphy and Florence Pugh about the
OL,9,Fscientists behind the top-secret
OL,10,FManhattan Project. It is the fourth
OL,11,Fhighest-grossing film of Nolan's
OL,12,Fcareer globally.
