OL,3,CThe Odyssey becomes highest-grossing
OL,4,Cfilm of Christopher Nolan's career
OL,6,FJim Orr, president of domestic
OL,7,Ftheatrical distribution at Universal
OL,8,FPictures, said: "Christopher Nolan has
OL,9,Fearned audiences' trust by
OL,10,Fconsistently delivering must-see
OL,11,Ftheatrical events, and The Odyssey is
OL,12,Fhim operating at the peak of his
OL,13,Fpowers.
OL,15,F"Nolan's epic film has been at the
OL,16,Fforefront of culture, with audiences
OL,17,Fseeking out premium formats and repeat
OL,18,Fviewings for this once-in-a-lifetime
OL,19,Fcinematic journey."
