OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1786375106
OL,3,CThe Odyssey becomes highest-grossing
OL,4,Cfilm of Christopher Nolan's career
OL,6,FVeronika Kwan Vandenberg, president of
OL,7,Fdistribution at Universal Pictures
OL,8,FInternational, hailed the film as "a
OL,9,Fglobal epic that has resonated with
OL,10,Faudiences everywhere with its massive
OL,11,Fscope and uncompromising vision".
OL,13,FThe Odyssey had a reported production
OL,14,Fbudget of $250 million (#185 million),
OL,15,Fexcluding marketing costs, making it
OL,16,Fone of the most expensive films of Sir
OL,17,FChristopher's career.
